// Registers field VALUES delivered inside authenticated session provenance
// (entries carrying an optional bounded string `value`). This is the only
// candidate source on snapshots whose bundles cannot reach the app API
// (cross-origin fetch is CORS-blocked) and on static builds with no runtime
// registrar at all. Pages values register ONLY for the currently-framed
// page's slug (legacy per-page matching semantics); shared blocks register
// unconditionally (they may render on any page). Existing keys are never
// overwritten — a fresher site-helper registration or a committed inline
// edit always wins over the mint-time value. Callers dispatch
// 'vunora:fields-ready' themselves.
